<title>USA: PSE to list long-term options on three stocks.</title>
<headline>PSE to list long-term options on three stocks.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said Thursday it would begin trading January 1998 and January 1999 long term options (LEAPS) on SBC Communications Inc, Signet Banking Corp and American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) of SmithKline Beecham on December 23.</p>
<p>The exchange said SBC LEAPS would have strike prices of 40, 50 and 60.</p>
<p>The Signet Banking LEAPS will have strikes of 25, 30 and 35, and the SmithKline ADR LEAPs will have strikes of 55, 70 and 85. ((-Derivatives desk,3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
